    "detected": "caught_at_field by a flag that is NOT cannot_verify and was NOT already raised on the error-free version of the same record",
    "sent_to_review": "the record is not auto_acceptable (any flag anywhere)",
    "unique": "one mutation = (conversation, field, new value[, edit]); repeats are not new trials"
  },
  "note": "PLANTED errors only (never pool with natural errors). Synthetic Kannada text, not native-validated. Report detected/caught next to the clean-field flag rate on the SAME records."
}
